\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Christians, awake, salute the happy morn,
\par Whereon the Saviour of the world was born;
\par Rise to adore the mystery of love,
\par Which hosts of angels chanted from above;
\par With them the joyful tidings first begun
\par Of God incarnate and the Virgin's Son.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Then to the watchful shepherds it was told,
\par Who heard the angelic herald's voice: Behold,
\par I bring good tidings of a Saviour's birth
\par To you and all the nations upon earth;
\par This day hath God fulfilled His promised word,
\par This day is born a Saviour, Christ the Lord.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

